{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lie, cheat, and steal your way to victory in Dirtbag Mahjong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character and join five other dirtbags for a night of riichi mahjong and misdemeanor assault. Nobody here plays fair, and they've all got some dirty tricks up their sleeves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dirtbag Mahjong is a complete and beginner-friendly mahjong experience that also offers some party game surprises to keep experienced players guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mode featuring an interesting night and unique conditions under which to try playing mahjong, with six different routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full riichi mahjong text guide and first steps interactive tutorial, to help ease beginners into the game or the more difficult story chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six playable characters with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free play mode with both &quot;standard&quot; or &quot;dirtbag&quot; rules, for a complete single-player mahjong experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty options ranging from beginner-friendly free play to harder story challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins for tiles and characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full gamepad support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full riichi mahjong text guide, and the first steps interactive tutorial to get beginners started</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prologue and the first chapter of 3 of the story routes</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Stinkiest Child","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com